## Part II: The Six Faces

Each face has:
- A **name** and **mood metaphor**
- A **background color**
- A **dominant typography** emphasis
- A **unique entrance animation**
- A **page-specific decorative element** (the thing that makes it unmistakably different)
- A **layout structure**

---

### Face 1: The Foyer — `HOME /`

> *"A warm, well-lit entryway where you get oriented before exploring the house."*

**Mood:** Confident, editorial, warm. Like the cover of Monocle magazine.

| Property | Value |
|---|---|
| Background | `#fafafa` (warm neutral-50) |
| Dominant font | **Inter** (massive headline) + **Playfair** (italic tagline) |
| Layout | 4-column / 8-column editorial grid |
| Animation | Gentle fade + slide-up (0.4s, easeOut) |

#### Structure

```
┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  JABIR ABDULLAH                                          │
│  HAIAN              (massive Inter, tracking-tighter)    │
│                                                          │
│  [Avatar]           "BBA in Accounting..."               │
│  Location           (Playfair, italic, text-2xl-4xl)     │
│  Email                                                   │
│  Tags               Bio paragraph (Inter, text-lg)       │
├──────────── ████████ warm accent divider ─────────────────┤
│  EDUCATION          University of Dhaka                  │
│  (sticky label)     BBA, Accounting & Information Systems│
│                     [skill pills] → Full timeline →      │
├────────────────────── thin rule ──────────────────────────┤
│  LEADERSHIP &       Morning Riders · President           │
│  EXPERIENCE         আলোকিত লাইব্রেরী · Secretariat      │
│                     → All experience & credentials →     │
├────────────────────── thin rule ──────────────────────────┤
│  CREDENTIALS        Cert names (compact) + skill pills   │
│                     → Full credentials →                 │
├──────────── ████████ warm accent divider ─────────────────┤
│  ● I also build things →                                 │
│  ● Fragments of thought →                                │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

#### Unique Element
The **hero headline scale** — `clamp(3rem, 12vw, 8rem)`. No other page uses text this large. The home page OWNS the massive typography. This is its signature.

#### Design Changes Needed
- [ ] **Section labels**: Change `SectionHeader` from bold uppercase sans (competing with content) to **quiet mono labels** — `font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-neutral-400` with a small accent underline. Same style as the experience page uses. This makes the labels ORIENT rather than DOMINATE.
- [ ] **Section spacing**: Reduce from `mb-24` (96px) to `mb-16` (64px). The accent dividers already create separation — the whitespace doesn't need to do double duty.
- [ ] **Avatar**: Increase from 80px to 120px. Or remove until a real photo is ready — the hero works fine as pure typography.
- [ ] **Skill pills on education**: Show only 4 curated, relevant skills (not 6 random LinkedIn exports). Remove "Cycling" from appearing here.
- [ ] **Add scroll-triggered entrance animations** on each section using `motion.div whileInView`. Currently only pages with `'use client'` have motion — the home page is server-rendered with no entrance animations.

