│    │  2026.02.27                                  │
│    │  The Entropy of Time                         │
│    │                                              │
│    │  Time doesn't just pass; it disperses...     │
│    │                                              │
│    │  #reflection  #physics  #code                │
│    │                                              │
│  ●─┤                                              │
│    │  2026.02.15                                  │
│    │  Accounting as a Language                    │
│    │                                              │
│    │  We often think of accounting as math...     │
│    │                                              │
│    │  #accounting  #theory                        │
│    │                                              │
